== Notes ==
* {{dlc|nr+}} If Isaac gets {{i|Key Piece 1}} and {{i|Key Piece 2}}, the key will open the golden gate to fight {{e|Mega Satan}}, but if Isaac uses {{i|Forget Me Now}}, the floor will reset and Isaac won't get both Key Pieces back, making it so that the golden gate won't open again.
** {{dlc|r+}} Golden gate to {{e|Mega Satan}} will stay opened after using {{i|Forget Me Now}}.
* {{dlc|r}}When playing as {{C|The Lost}} or {{C|Tainted Lost}}, it is advised to open all the devil deal chests in the starting room, as only one of the four items can be taken and all the other chests will disappear.
* {{dlc|r}} Taking the devil deals generated by the chests will NOT prevent {{r|Angel Room}}s from appearing.
* {{dlc|r}}If {{p|Jera}} is used in the initial room with the devil deal chests, the newly spawned chests will contain four additional and distinct devil deals.
* {{dlc|a}}The {{r|I AM ERROR}} room cannot be reached by any method in {{s|Chest}} and the Dark Room.
** {{dlc+|r}}The {{r|I AM ERROR}} room can be reached by leaving a {{r|Crawl Space}} through an unintended direction. The room will always contain a portal leading to {{s|The Void}}.{{dlc-}}

