== Trivia ==
* The Dark Room is the only floor in the game which is original to the initial release of ''Rebirth''. All the other floors included in ''Rebirth'' at its launch were from the original ''The Binding of Isaac'' and its DLC ''Wrath of the Lamb''.
* The Dark Room is also the name of a room which, like its name suggests, is plunged into complete darkness, for the notable purpose of processing photos. The fact that access to this floor is granted by touching the chest in {{s|Sheol}} while holding {{i|The Negative}}, which is the name given to a photo that has not been processed yet and whose colors and hues are inverted, might be a nod to this.
* The layout to The Chest and the Dark Room are identical for a given seed.
* {{dlc|na}} One of the {{r|Super Secret Room}} layouts is of the Dark Room and a {{e|Black Heart}}. The sprite for the door is a portal rather than a gray door, however, since bombed-out entrances in the Dark Room appear as portals.
** This secret room appears floating in a black void on most floors, but in the Dark Room, it appears in a purple misty void instead, just like all the other rooms.
** {{dlc|a}} This secret room takes the appearance of a {{r|Library}} instead.
* One possible room in the Dark Room contains only a {{e|Bony}} and a {{e|Lil' Haunt}}. These possibly represent {{C|The Forgotten}} and {{C|The Soul}}.
* On the [https://youtu.be/xcR9TAOozww 6/2/2021 Kickstarter livestream], Edmund McMillen confirmed that the Dark Room represents the closet that Isaac was locked inside in Ending 21.
* The theme of Dark Room (''Devoid'') is noticeably shorter than other floor themed soundtracks. This is because a floor theme is comprised of 2 parts. The 1st part is the normal theme, and the 2nd part is for the more intense version of the track when an enemy room with a combined high health count is entered. There is no "Intense" theme for when a high health room in Dark Room is entered. The {{s|Cathedral}}'s theme (''Everlasting Hymn'') is also shorter than other tracks, but does have a barely noticeable secondary intense part of the track.

== Music ==
* The music for the Dark Room is titled ''Devoid'', which means "empty".<ref>[https://ridiculon.bandcamp.com/album/the-binding-of-isaac-rebirth-ost Binding of Isaac: Rebirth OST]</ref>

